OL,3,CNurses being 'exploited' in social
OL,4,Ccare, experts warn
OL,6,FNurses are being "exploited" in the
OL,7,Fsocial care sector, leading medics
OL,8,Fhave warned.
OL,10,FThe Royal College of Nursing (RCN) has
OL,11,Fwarned that some migrant workers who
OL,12,Fcome to England to work in social care
OL,13,Fare being underpaid, having their visa
OL,14,Fstatus used as leverage to demand
OL,15,F"huge" repayments, and seeing their
OL,16,Fpay and conditions changed after
OL,17,Farriving.
OL,26,@nD@ROUnD@\O]wD@AOUwD@FO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/7
