OL,3,CNurses being 'exploited' in social
OL,4,Ccare, experts warn
OL,6,FThe college said it has seen a surge
OL,7,Fin people seeking support over
OL,8,F"exploitative practices", including
OL,9,Fexcessive working hours, high exit
OL,10,Ffees, poor and overcrowded
OL,11,Faccommodation, and illegal work-
OL,12,Ffinding charges.
OL,14,FA new RCN report warns that "the
OL,15,Finhumane treatment of staff who have
OL,16,Fcome to support the UK's social care
OL,17,Fsystem poses a serious risk to the
OL,18,Fsector's stability".
OL,26,@pD@AOUpD@XO]vD@]OUzD@SO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/7
