OL,3,CNurses being 'exploited' in social
OL,4,Ccare, experts warn
OL,6,FIt comes after Prime Minister Andy
OL,7,FBurnham pledged to "put everything
OL,8,FI've got" into fixing adult social
OL,9,Fcare.
OL,11,FHe said successive governments had
OL,12,Ffailed to reform social care in
OL,13,FEngland because it was seen as "too
OL,14,Frisky, too difficult and too
OL,15,Fcomplicated", and called for cross-
OL,16,Fparty consensus to deliver lasting
OL,17,Fchange.
OL,26,@oD@TOUpD@IO]uD@`OUwD@LO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/7
