PN,31404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786112311
OL,3,CNurses being 'exploited' in social
OL,4,Ccare, experts warn
OL,6,FThe report, which examined the
OL,7,Fexperiences of 383 staff who sought
OL,8,Fsupport from the RCN between 2023 and
OL,9,F2025, details cases where employers
OL,10,Fallegedly used repayment clauses to
OL,11,Frecover costs from workers wanting to
OL,12,Fleave their jobs before the end of
OL,13,Ftheir contracts.
OL,15,FOne worker was reportedly asked to
OL,16,Frepay #25,000.
OL,18,FOthers said they had been paid below
OL,19,Ftheir agreed contractual hourly rate,
OL,20,Fwhile some reported being forced to
OL,21,Fwork longer hours than expected.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
