SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786112311
OL,3,CNurses being 'exploited' in social
OL,4,Ccare, experts warn
OL,6,FRCN chief executive and general
OL,7,Fsecretary Professor Nicola Ranger
OL,8,Fsaid: "Just a week after the prime
OL,9,Fminister laid out his plans for social
OL,10,Fcare in England, this report exposes
OL,11,Fthe scale of grotesque exploitation
OL,12,Ftaking place in the sector.
OL,14,F"A National Care Service meeting the
OL,15,Fneeds of an ageing population, with
OL,16,Fcomplex conditions, will need to be
OL,17,Fregistered nurse led. We're the ones
OL,18,Fwith the skill and expertise to make
OL,19,Fit work, but that cannot happen while
OL,20,Fso many of our migrant colleagues are
OL,21,Fbeing exploited."
OL,26,@pD@GOUvD@AOU}D@QO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/7
