PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786112311
OL,3,CNurses being 'exploited' in social
OL,4,Ccare, experts warn
OL,6,FA government spokesperson said: "This
OL,7,Fgovernment stands firm on our zero-
OL,8,Ftolerance approach to labour
OL,9,Fexploitation and abuse of our
OL,10,Fimmigration system by unscrupulous
OL,11,Femployers.
OL,13,F"We are taking action against rogue
OL,14,Fcare providers who have used their
OL,15,Fsponsor licence to exploit workers,
OL,16,Fand we've ended overseas recruitment
OL,17,Ffor care workers after unacceptable
OL,18,Flevels of abuse and exploitation."
OL,26,@nD@aOUuD@AOUzD@bO]
